Version 0.4.2 (2026-02-04)
--------------------------
Bounded Schema Cache with LRU Eviction (#002-bounded-schema-cache)

This is a **backward-compatible patch release** that fixes a memory leak while improving performance.

**Fixed:**
- Unbounded schema cache memory leak in long-running services (v0.4.1 regression)
  - Previous unbounded map could grow indefinitely with unique schemas
  - Now uses LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction with configurable bounds

**Added:**
- `GetCacheStats() CacheStats` - Monitor cache performance (size, hits, misses, evictions, hit rate)
- `SetSchemaCacheConfig(maxSize int) error` - Configure cache size at runtime (default: 1000 entries)
- `ClearSchemaCache()` - Manually invalidate cache when needed

**Performance Improvements:**
- Cache hit latency: 45% faster than v0.4.1 (21ns vs 38ns)
- Zero allocations on cache hits (down from 1 allocation in v0.4.1)
- Bounded memory usage: ~250KB for default 1000-entry cache

**Technical Details:**
- LRU cache implementation using container/list (doubly-linked list)
- Thread-safe with sync.RWMutex and atomic counters
- Test coverage: 93.7% (up from 92.0%)
- 18 new unit tests + 8 benchmarks
- Zero race conditions verified with 100 concurrent goroutines

**Migration:** Fully backward compatible - no code changes required. Cache configuration is optional.

Version 0.4.1 (2025-06-15)
--------------------------
Performance Optimization Release (#001-performance-optimization)

This is a **backward-compatible patch release** focused on performance improvements with zero breaking changes.

**Performance Improvements:**
- Schema caching: 99% faster for repeated schemas (6744ns → 38ns)
- Context shredding: 92% faster with 84% fewer allocations (14899ns → 1175ns)
- Event mapping: 71% faster with 50% fewer allocations (46027ns → 13402ns)
- JSON transformation: 59% faster (55024ns → 22816ns)
- String operations: 55% faster (201ns → 91ns)
- Schema extraction: 89% faster with 98% fewer allocations (6253ns → 701ns)

**Technical Details:**
- Implemented thread-safe schema cache with sync.RWMutex
- Pre-allocated maps and slices with capacity hints
- Optimized insertUnderscores with strings.Builder
- Added 6 new benchmarks for performance tracking
- Maintained 92.0% test coverage
- Zero race conditions verified

**Backward Compatibility:** 100% - All existing APIs unchanged, all tests pass

